shion","max":"Maxed out ✔","secret":"Secret achievement","trc":"-{v} s for attention to drop 1% (max -{x} s)","hd":"Police forget faster (+{v}% per second, per level)","fd":"More credibility (+{v}% earnings per level)","now":"now:","buy":"Buy","perclick":"per click","persec":"per second","vpn":"-{v}% attention per click (max -{x}%)","conf":"Erase progress and start over?","bust":"🚔 Busted! You lost {p}% of your balance:","won":"Your empire is built, with the best home and style this jurisdiction allows. But the balance is made of real people, and the police have just rung the doorbell.","gave":"💸 The victim gave in! You earned","top":"You are at the top. Buy the best home and style this jurisdiction allows.","bribe":"💶 Pay a bribe (-{c}% clean money)","bribe_ok":"💸 Bribe paid! Attention dropped.","bribe_no":"❌ Not enough clean money!","mx":"MAX","clean":"Clean","dirty":"Dirty","lucky":"Generous client!","slot":"Slot","op":"Op:","sfx":"Sound effects","mus":"Background music","vol":"Volume","lg":"Language","opn":"Operator name","opph":"Name... (max 13)","sl_sh":"Choose a slot to save your progress:","sl_lh":"Choose a slot to load:","sl_empty":"Empty","sl_act":"Active","sl_over":"Overwrite","sl_save":"Save","sl_load":"Load","sl_del":"Delete","sl_saved":"Saved in slot {n}!","sl_loaded":"Game loaded from slot {n}!","sl_delq":"Delete slot {n}?","sl_deld":"Slot {n} deleted.","stg":"Stage {n}","pres_q":"Pay the {d} clean-money deposit and flee to another jurisdiction? You lose money, items, home, team and investments, but gain {g} 🛂 (+{p}% income).","pres_ok":"New jurisdiction! +{g} 🛂","pres_t":"Change jurisdiction","pres_d":"Flee to a tax haven: you need {d} in CLEAN money for the deposit (dirty money doesn't cross the border). You gain passports (+5% income each).","pres_b":"Flee","keep":"Keep playing (free mode)","lb_t":"Front businesses","lb_d":"They launder dirty money so the police can't seize it.","lb_c":"cleans","lbn":["Car wash","Newsstand","Crypto firm","Front casino","Hotel chain","Shell bank"],"newsm":["TV report on scams! +50% police attention.","Black Friday! Click earnings doubled.","Police busy elsewhere! Attention drops faster.","Rush hour! Automatic earnings doubled.","Birthday cake at the police station! For now, bribes have a 100% success rate.","The whole police station went out for lunch! For now, bribes have a 100% success rate."],"crs":[{"q":"A victim is trying to call the police!","o":["📵 Hang up and change your number","🗣️ Keep talking","🤐 Stay silent and wait"],"s":["You hang up on reflex and swap numbers. The flustered victim calls the police… and ends up ordering a pineapple pizza from a very confused police station. You stay off the radar.","You keep talking so much that the victim records everything and sends it to the police like a podcast. The episode is a hit among the inspectors and your attention goes up.","The silence is so awkward that the victim gives up and goes to water the plants. Nothing happens. The plants are grateful."]},{"q":"A journalist is asking questions!","o":["📱 Change your number and vanish","💶 Try to pay for silence","🙈 Pretend it was a mistake"],"s":["You change numbers so fast that the journalist ends up interviewing an insurance call centre. The story loses its main character and your attention drops.","The journalist records the offer and turns it into the headline of the day: “Scammer tries to bribe the press”. You lose money and gain fame.","“A mistake? But I never said your name…” He gives up on the fourteenth call and goes to write a story about cats."]},{"q":"A rival wants a cut of your scheme!","o":["🤝 Propose a “partnership”","😤 Threaten the rival","🔌 Unplug the router"],"s":["You propose a partnership. The rival, moved, agrees to pay you a “friendship commission” and even brings cake. You make money.","The threat backfires: the rival is better at threatening than you and takes part of the cash. Lesson learned: never argue with someone who has more cables.","You unplug the router and the rival stares at the screen watching the loading wheel spin. Neither of you wins anything."]},{"q":"Tax inspector at the door!","o":["☕ Offer coffee and a chat","🏃 Run down the stairs","🪟 Pretend you're not home"],"s":["The coffee is so good that the inspector asks for the recipe and forgets to ask about the paperwork. He leaves whistling and your attention drops.","You run down the stairs, but the lift was broken… and so was the roof door. The inspector finds you clinging to a flowerpot. Attention goes up.","You hide behind the sofa for an hour. The inspector leaves a note and goes away. Nothing changes (except your back)."]},{"q":"The neighbour is complaining about the phone noise!","o":["🍰 Bring him a cake","🔊 Turn up the volume","🎧 Switch to headphones"],"s":["The cake is carrot cake and the neighbour has a sweet tooth: he becomes your best “security guard” and warns you whenever he sees a police car. Attention drops and the police are distracted for a little while.","You turn up the volume and the neighbour calls the police… for noise. They come knocking and your attention goes up.","You switch to headphones. The neighbour sleeps soundly and you get earache. Nothing changes."]},{"q":"Power cut at the office!","o":["🔋 Start grandpa's generator","🕯️ Carry on by candlelight","😴 Take a nap"],"s":["Grandpa's generator starts with a heroic roar and powers everything, even the coffee machine. Click earnings doubled for a while.","By candlelight, your paperwork catches fire and you spend part of the cash putting it out with whatever you had at hand. You lose money.","You take a great nap. When you wake up, the power is back too. Nothing happened."]},{"q":"Surprise tax audit: they want to see all the books!","o":["🧮 Pay the accountant to \"tidy up\" the paperwork","🔥 Burn the papers at a barbecue","😇 Hand everything over and pray"],"s":["The accountant produces three invoices from 2009 and a stamp nobody can read. The inspector leaves convinced everything is in order. Attention falls.","The smoke calls the fire brigade, the fire brigade calls the police and the police call the inspector. You lose money and attention rises.","The inspector reads everything carefully, yawns, signs and leaves. This time nothing happens."]},{"q":"Data leak: your files have appeared on a forum!","o":["🛡️ Hire a cybersecurity team","🧹 Delete the forum \"by hand\"","📢 Claim the files are fake"],"s":["The team shuts the forum, changes every password and leaves a friendly invoice. The traces disappear and attention falls.","You discover that deleting a forum \"by hand\" means wiping your own bank account. You lose money and attention rises.","Nobody believes it, but nobody has time to investigate. The day passes and nothing happens."]},{"q":"A rival hacker threatens to report you unless you pay!","o":["💸 Pay for his silence","🎭 Strike back with a fake profile","📵 Ignore and block him"],"s":["You pay, he thanks you and promises to forget about you for a good while. The police are busy elsewhere and attention falls.","The counter-attack backfires: the hacker had your fake profile as a client. You lose money and attention rises.","You block him. He gives up blackmailing you, but he keeps your phone number. Nothing changes."]},{"q":"Your mule was stopped at customs with a suspicious suitcase!","o":["⚖️ Hire an airport lawyer","🛫 Leave the mule to fate","💶 Bribe the customs officer"],"s":["The lawyer shows up in a shiny suit with an empty briefcase, cites three articles nobody has heard of, and the mule is released “for lack of evidence”. The mule thanks you and asks for a holiday. Attention drops.","You leave the mule to fate. The suitcase is seized, the team gossips about you for weeks, and you lose part of the dirty money. The police are pleased with the arrest and attention drops a little.","The envelope changes hands and the officer swears he never saw that suitcase. The mule walks through with a nervous smile. It works, but it's expensive and attention rises."]},{"q":"Regulators and furious victims at the door!","o":["⚖️ Hire a top lawyer","🔥 Deny everything live on social media","🌴 Pretend you're on holiday"],"s":["The lawyer arrives in a suit and tie, quotes a clause in Latin and the regulators leave convinced they had the wrong address. Attention drops.","You deny everything live and the whole chat has the receipts. The video hits millions of views and the fine arrives right after. You lose money and attention rises.","You answer the door in a straw hat with a cocktail in hand, but the regulators only want a coffee. They drink it, take notes and leave. Nothing changes."]},{"q":"One of your subordinates says he'll «tell the police everything»!","o":["🤝 Hear him out in private and give him a raise","🔥 Threaten him to keep quiet","🏖️ Pay for a holiday so he can cool off"],"s":["You listen to his rant, raise his pay and he goes back to work swearing eternal loyalty. Attention drops.","You threaten him and he storms out… straight to the nearest police station. You lose a team member and attention rises.","You pay for a week on a remote beach. He comes back tanned and quiet, but the bill stings a little."]}],"cr_hit":"Victim called the police! +25% attention.","cr_ok":"Crisis handled!","b_ring":"📞 *Riiiing... Riiiing... Click!*","b_l1":"Boss: 'Hello? You finally picked up! I saw your ad in the classifieds. We need fresh blood at our financial consultancy.'","b_l2":"Boss: 'What's your name, rookie? Tell me so I can register you in the system.'","b_l3":"Boss: 'Alright, {name}. Your desk is that dusty old laptop in the corner, on the neighbour's Wi-Fi.'","b_l4":"Boss: 'Your mission is simple: send some inheritance emails. Get to work and keep the police off our backs!'","b_ph":"Your name... (max 13)","b_reply":"Reply","b_go":"Start working! 💼","b_def":"Operator","ch_hi":"Hello? Who is this?","sx":[{"n":"Prince Email","a":"Send mass email","s":"You live in a rented room on the neighbour's Wi-Fi. An 'exiled prince' needs help moving an inheritance.","t":"Strangers don't leave you fortunes. Urgency + easy money + upfront payment = scam.","v":"Aunt Lurdes, retired, got an email about an inheritance"},{"n":"Fake Tech Support","a":"Call about a 'virus'","s":"You've got a headset and a confident voice: 'Good morning, Microsoft support...'","t":"Tech giants never cold-call about viruses. Never grant remote access.","v":"Mr. Armando, thinks his old PC has a virus"},{"n":"Gift Cards","a":"Demand payment in vouchers","s":"You say the tax office only takes store vouchers. Absurd, yet it works too often.","t":"No real institution asks to be paid in gift cards.","v":"Mrs. Fátima, got a fake debt notice"},{"n":"Toll SMS","a":"Blast 'overdue fee' texts","s":"One message, one link and a small amount. Nobody remembers driving on that motorway.","t":"Don't tap links in texts that demand fees. Go to the official website or app, typing the address yourself.","v":"Carla, always in a hurry"},{"n":"Digital Cupid","a":"Send a romantic message","s":"A pretty profile, a 'mission abroad' and lots of late-night messages. Online love is patient… and expensive.","t":"Someone who has never met you in person and already asks for money isn't in love. Refusing video calls is a red flag.","v":"Isabel, a widow looking for company"},{"n":"Dream Job","a":"Post a fake job ad","s":"'Earn €500 a day liking videos.' You only need to pay for the 'training'.","t":"Real jobs don't charge you to hire you. Absurd pay for simple tasks is a trap.","v":"Rui, unemployed for months"},{"n":"Lottery Without a Ticket","a":"Announce a surprise prize","s":"'You've won a prize!' But you only get it after paying the collection tax.","t":"You can't win a lottery you never entered. Anyone asking for a fee to release a prize wants your money.","v":"Zé Manel, the lucky one"},{"n":"Phantom Holiday Home","a":"List a non-existent apartment","s":"Sea view, bargain price and a deposit by bank transfer. The house only exists in the photos.","t":"A price too good to be true plus a deposit before seeing the place is a red flag. Ask for a video call and use protected payments.","v":"The Santos family, cheap holidays"},{"n":"Ghost Auctions","a":"Post a fake listing","s":"The buyer pays and the item is always 'on its way'.","t":"Be wary of low prices and payments outside the platform.","v":"Miguel, looking for a cheap console"},{"n":"Luxury Influencer","a":"Sell 'invest with me'","s":"Rented cars, borrowed watches and get-rich courses.","t":"Online luxury proves nothing. 'Guaranteed' returns are a red flag.","v":"Joana, who wants to get rich quick"},{"n":"Phantom Charity","a":"Ask for urgent donations","s":"After every disaster, a charity is born. Some only exist on your phone.","t":"Check that the charity exists and is officially registered. Be wary of pressure and payments in gift cards or crypto.","v":"Mrs. Amélia, generous by nature"},{"n":"Fake Tax Office","a":"Send a 'tax refund'","s":"'You have money coming.' Just confirm your card on this very official link.","t":"Tax authorities don't ask for card details by email or text. Always log in to the official portal.","v":"Mr. Eduardo, model taxpayer"},{"n":"SIM Swap","a":"Swap someone's SIM card","s":"You convince a carrier to move another person's number to you. The movie has an ending.","t":"If your phone loses signal for no reason, call your carrier. Enable a SIM PIN.","v":"Ricardo, whose phone just lost signal"},{"n":"Fake Celebrity","a":"Launch a celebrity ad","s":"An AI-made video of a famous face recommending your 'investment'. They never knew.","t":"Ads with celebrities recommending investments are almost always fake. Video and voice can be AI-generated.","v":"Beatriz, biggest fan"},{"n":"Fake CEO","a":"Give an urgent 'boss' order","s":"A cloned voice asks for an urgent, secret transfer.","t":"Confirm urgent money requests through another channel.","v":"Helena, in accounting"},{"n":"We'll Recover Your Money","a":"Promise to recover losses","s":"You scam the victims of scams. A 'processing fee' fixes everything. Except the money.","t":"Anyone who charges upfront to recover lost money is running another scam. Report it to the police, who don't charge.","v":"Mr. Joaquim, scammed once before"},{"n":"Property Pyramid","a":"Invite new 'investors'","s":"You pay early members with newcomers' money.","t":"Commissions for recruiting friends are a pyramid-scheme sign.","v":"Sónia, wants to invest her savings"},{"n":"Ghost Coin","a":"Launch a fake token","s":"You promise 100x. When the price rises, the creator vanishes.","t":"Nobody guarantees crypto profits.","v":"Tiago, saw a token on social media"},{"n":"Ghost Bank","a":"Move millions offshore","s":"Island accounts that only exist on paper.","t":"Large-scale schemes always get uncovered.","v":"Dr. Álvaro, a suspicious investor"},{"n":"Orbital Empire","a":"Sell lunar citizenship","s":"Passports from a country that doesn't exist, on a territory nobody has visited. Genius.","t":"If the offer is absurd, the only thing that gets there is your money. No scheme is police-proof.","v":"Dr. Marques, passport collector"},{"n":"Phantom Shop","a":"Open a fake online shop","s":"Impossible prices, stolen photos and a counter saying \"only 2 left\".","t":"Prices far below normal, bank transfer only and a brand-new site = fake shop. Look for reviews outside the site.","v":"Inês, an influencer who wants a cheap ring light"},{"n":"Parcel on Hold","a":"Send delivery texts","s":"\"Your parcel is on hold. Pay €1.99 postage.\" The link opens a page that looks just like the post office.","t":"Couriers do not ask for payments by text. Type the official website address yourself.","v":"Mr Albino, online shop with 40 parcels"},{"n":"Swapped QR","a":"Stick fake QR codes","s":"A sticker over the QR code on the parking meter. Whoever pays for parking pays you.","t":"Check whether the QR code is stuck over another one. Pay at the machine or in the official app.","v":"Mr Aurélio, a retired teacher learning to pay by phone"},{"n":"Generous Buyer","a":"Overpay on the marketplace","s":"You want the neighbour's sofa, you \"overpay by mistake\" and ask for the change. Your payment never existed.","t":"Nobody overpays by mistake. Never refund money before you see it in your account, and never go to a cash machine to \"receive\" money.","v":"Dinis, a crypto fan selling his console"},{"n":"Cloned Voice","a":"Clone a voice","s":"Three seconds of a social media video and the AI talks like the victim's son: \"Mum, I had an accident, I need money now.\"","t":"Agree on a family code word. Hang up and call back on the number you already know.","v":"Mrs Rosa, a grandmother with two phones"},{"n":"Fake Video Call","a":"Pose as the director","s":"A video call with the \"director\" and three colleagues. All fake, except the person making the transfer.","t":"Urgent transfers, even when asked on video, must be checked through another channel. Faces and voices can be faked now.","v":"Vasco, a startup founder"},{"n":"Robot Romance","a":"Set a chatbot dating","s":"Your chatbot writes poems, never sleeps and dates a hundred people at once. On day one hundred, there is an \"emergency\".","t":"If you have never met them in person and they ask for money, it is a scam, human or machine.","v":"Henrique, lonely and in love with a chat"},{"n":"Investment Bot","a":"Sell a millionaire bot","s":"An ad with a fake celebrity promises that \"quantum AI\" multiplies savings. It only multiplies yours.","t":"No AI guarantees profits. Celebrities recommending investments in ads are almost always fake.","v":"Mr Matias, a house full of smart assistants"}],"nm":["Old laptop","Helpful cousin","Cheap headset","Call operator","Voucher machine","Shift crew","SMS modem","Phone farm","Fake military-pilot profile","Team of 'boyfriends'","VPN (less police)","Trace cleaner","Fake job ad","Rent-a-recruiters","Fake winning ticket","Prize call centre","Stolen photo album","Phantom estate agency","Fake list