cd_used":"You already used this code.","cd_clipe":"📎 “It looks like you're trying to fool someone. Want some help?” 🎟️ +1 scratch card","cd_modem":"📠 56k connection established! Clicks ×2 for 15 s.","cd_obrigado":"🙏 You're welcome! Tip: +{x}","cd_42":"🌌 The answer is 42. The question was “how long until the police arrive?”. Heat −10%.","cd_abra":"🎩 Magic! +1 🕶️ contact.","cd_burlao":"🗃️ Jorge kept a keepsake for you: {n}","cd_burlao2":"Jorge has no more keepsakes for you. 😅","tte":"ScamOperator.exe is not responding… but keeps working. (Task manager: 100% CPU, 0% conscience.)","av_in":"(The call was transferred without warning. Someone different picks up.)","av_h":["Meeeow? (You hear purring and paper being shredded.)","Who dares interrupt my quinoa ritual?","Beep. I am this victim's virtual assistant. How may I deceive you today?","Greetings, Earth human. I am calling from Scamon-7. What is a “transfer”?","Who's that? Who's that? Scammer! Scammer! (A very well-informed parrot.)","Ooooh… I still have bills to pay from the 17th century…","Good afternoon. This is the Shark. I love it when someone calls me with money-making ideas.","ROAR. (Subtitles: “Prehistoric Resources Department, how may I help?”)","Arrr! Who dares call the ship? Speak, landlubber!","BEEP. Room: living room. Obstacle detected: you. What can I vacuum for you?","Hello. Before you say anything: I already know your IP, your star sign and what you had for lunch.","Good heavens! What contraption is this that talks without wires? What year is it?","Woooo… hello? Nobody has called me in two hundred years. Speak, speak!","Who dares interrupt my quest? This magic mirror vibrates a lot, sir.","Good evening… You called at an excellent time. The sun has set.","Meow. (the cat stepped on the answer button)"],"av_w":["The cat transferred everything… and left a paw print on the keyboard.","The wizard transferred the money with a wave of his wand. “Abracadabra, scam!”","The assistant approved the transfer. “Beep beep. Success.”","The alien paid in galactic currency… which the bank accepted. Surprisingly.","The parrot recited the victim's IBAN. It was the only one who knew it by heart.","The ghost paid up and promised to haunt the police for you.","The shark paid. Respect is respect.","The dinosaur paid in meteorites… I mean, euros.","Arrr! Take this treasure map and ten doubloons! It's worth more than a card.","BEEP. Transfer authorised: I found €3.40 and a button under the sofa. Sent.","OK, you fooled me. Respect. Here… and by the way, your antivirus is out of date.","Here, five gold sovereigns from 1887! I don't know if they're still worth anything, but they shine.","Take the family jewels. They're in the attic, right under me.","Take my purse of coins and swear to serve the realm!","Keep my card… blue blood, unlimited credit.","Meow. (the cat pushed its owner's card onto the keyboard: 0000 1111 2222 3333)"],"av_l":["The cat hung up and lay down on the keyboard.","The wizard turned the phone into a frog. You hung up, of course.","The assistant replied “I did not understand your request” for five minutes.","The alien burst out laughing and the call dropped into space.","The parrot screamed “police! police!”. You can't tell if it was joking.","The ghost passed through the line and vanished.","The shark saw through the scheme and nearly ate you alive.","The dinosaur stepped on the phone. That's all you heard.","Arrr! That's cabin-boy talk. Walk the plank!","BEEP. Threat detected. Returning to base. Goodbye.","Who scams a hacker? I've already changed your Wi-Fi password. Good luck.","That didn't exist in my time and it won't exist in yours. Farewell!","Woooo! I'll haunt your phone. Forever.","Villain! On my honour, I shall hang up this mirror!","Hmm. I smell garlic. Goodbye.","Hsss! (the cat hung up with its paw)"],"cc_t":"Office colleague","cc_who":"Jorge · 2nd floor","cc_d":"Jorge works on the 2nd floor and sends you messages, tips and questions. Some questions have two answers, with small consequences.","cc_none":"No messages yet. Jorge usually shows up shortly after you start working.","cc_hi":"Boss, did you turn the A/C on? It's a sauna down here and the phones are melting. Anything you need, I'm on the 2nd floor.","cc_ch0":"Nice, you're moving up in the world! Jorge's tip: when police attention climbs too high, use “Lie low” and let things cool off.","cc_q1":"Boss, the crew wants a team dinner. Are you paying, or does everyone pay their own?","cc_q1o":["I'm paying 🍕","Everyone pays their own"],"cc_q1r":["Now that's a boss! The crew is all fired up.","Well… saving is a skill too. I'll bring the bread."],"cc_tipclean":"Boss, dirty money stinks. Don't just sit on it: a front business launders it little by little, and clean money buys the good stuff. It's in the Money tab.","cc_hint1":"I found a sticky note on the old intern's monitor: “CLIPE”. Looks like a password. You could try it in Settings.","cc_bust1":"Boss, I saw the police outside. What a scare! Don't worry, I hid the evidence… in the fridge. (Tip: a good lawyer makes all the difference at times like these.)","cc_tiplie":"Careful, attention is sky-high! Take a breath and use the actions that lower it (“Lie low”, “Shred evidence”…) before it's too late.","cc_ch1":"People are already talking about you around here! From now on it's love, jobs and prizes that fall for the bait. Careful: hearts hurt too… in the wallet.","cc_q2":"Boss, I found a lost USB stick on the stairs. Can I plug it into the company computer?","cc_q2o":["Go ahead","Don't even think about it"],"cc_q2r":["It had some useful files… and a program that started by itself. You made a little cash, but the police got interested.","Good call. USB sticks found in the street are like emails from princes: nothing but trouble."],"cc_tipsv":"Have you seen Clean services in the Money tab? Lawyer, accountant, PR… all paid with clean money, and all of them help. Choose wisely.","cc_tipcw":"Boss, what if you kept some of the dirty money in the cold vault? It's safe from seizures. It takes a while to withdraw, but you sleep better.","cc_col1":"I see you earned your first keepsake! The collection is in Life → More. Completing sets gives bonuses, and they say there are hidden combinations…","cc_pop1":"Well spotted: you closed the “you won an iFone” window. Only the distracted click “Claim”.","cc_bsod":"Blue screen?! No worries, boss, it happens in the best families. I just turn it off and on again. Fixes it almost every time.","cc_fury":"Wow, what fury! Your fingers were moving at the speed of sound. The neighbours asked you to stop hammering the keyboard.","cc_ch2":"Now it's the age of networks and followers. People trust whoever has lots of “likes”. What a lovely world we live in.","cc_q3":"Boss, the next-door neighbour asked why the phones ring at 3 a.m. What do I tell her?","cc_q3o":["We're a customer support centre","Offer her a cake"],"cc_q3r":["She believed it… and now wants to call and complain about a product. New ideas!","She loved the cake. The complaint can wait."],"cc_jack":"I heard someone hit the jackpot at the casino! Don't tell anyone, but if it was you, invite Jorge to dinner.","cc_sb1":"The one who caught you was a scambaiter. They love wasting our time and money. Watch out for calls that seem too good to be true.","cc_bust3":"Three seizures… boss, either you're very unlucky or you're a generous involuntary taxpayer. 😅 Ever thought about a lawyer?","cc_esc1":"You made it out! Tell me everything when you're back. I'll look after the office. I'll just use your chair… and your coffee… and your phone.","cc_crash":"Markets are crashing! If you hold crypto, pray. If you don't, pretend you never heard of it.","cc_hint2":"Confession: whenever the phone rings I mutter “MODEM”. It's got to do with the noise at the start of the call. Ever tried typing that into Settings?","cc_ch3":"This is serious tech now: SIM swaps, cloned voices, knock-off celebrities… The police are evolving too, so don't relax.","cc_q4":"Boss, a journalist wants to interview you. “The anonymous scammer”. Do you accept?","cc_q4o":["Accept (wearing a mask)","Decline"],"cc_q4r":["The interview was a hit! You're famous now… not a great idea for someone trying to stay unnoticed.","Good call. What isn't said can't be proven. Better to be a ghost."],"cc_esc2":"Another getaway! I'm starting to get jealous. Which island are you on this time? Send a photo.","cc_hint3":"When life looks like one big question mark, remember: the answer is always the same. 42. In Settings, preferably.","cc_ch4":"Pyramids, ghost coins, offshores… and something called the Moon? Boss, you're going too far. (But you have my support.)","cc_win":"Boss, you conquered this world! If anyone asks, I never knew you. But drop by the 2nd floor someday for a coffee.","cfg_tk":"Satirical news ticker","hs_t":"Your place","hs_empty":"Keepsakes you earn show up here.","tk_l":["Exiled prince needs urgent help. Again.","“IT technician” calls thousands of grandparents; not a single computer was infected.","Tax office only takes gift cards? Experts confirm: “they never did”.","Toll SMS is back: 87% of recipients don't even own a car.","Phones ringing non-stop: “it's always the same number”, complains neighbour.","Gift card sales soar; nobody knows who they're being given to.","Record numbers fall in love with “engineers on oil rigs”.","Dream job: “liking videos” pays €500 a day. 40,000 applicants already.","Ticketless lottery crowns another “winner”: they only need to pay the tax.","Holiday homes with sea views… and no address. Demand up 300%.","Cupid on weak Wi-Fi: long-distance love gets pricier by the day.","Unemployment falls… in the fake-ad statistics.","Consoles for €50: the order has been “on its way” for three months.","Influencer buys 3rd rented car; “get-rich-quick” course sold out.","New charity appears two hours after the disaster. Still no address.","Tax office warns: “we don't ask for your card by email”. The warning went to spam.","Bought followers now outnumber the country's population. Who reads the comments?","“Guaranteed” tax refund: taxpayers confirm their details on the very official link.","Phone has no signal at 3 a.m.? Could be a coincidence. Or not.","Celebrity “recommends” investment in video; celebrity says they've never seen the video.","Accountant wires €200k at the request of the “boss's voice”; the boss was on holiday.","Company promises to recover money lost to scams; charges upfront, of course.","AI learns to mimic your voice from 3 seconds of audio. Careful when you answer.","Experts: “if someone calls to warn you about a scam, hang up and call back yourself”.","Property pyramid promises 40% a month; those at the top have already moved abroad.","New lunar coin soars 900% in 2 hours; creators vanish in 3.","Island with 12,000 offshore accounts and 14 inhabitants. Coincidence?","Lunar passports for sale: “no atmosphere, but excellent prospects”.","Markets in panic: nobody knows where the money comes from. Or where it goes.","Government sets up a committee to investigate the committee investigating the scam.","Police seize cash from scam suspect; suspect swears he's never seen it.","Police shut down another makeshift “call centre” in a garage. Coffee still warm.","Historic seizure: police take the cash and the sofa.","New scheme on the loose: experts say victims “seem confused, but polite”.","Scammer vanishes without a trace. Left only a laundry receipt.","Markets in free fall; analysts blame “gravity”.","Stocks surge for no apparent reason; analysts urge “calm and popcorn”.","Player hits jackpot and vows to invest it all in “serious things”.","“Congratulations, you won an iFone” virus infects 3 million computers. Nobody won.","Phone operator breaks click record; the mouse asks for sick leave.","Scammer of the year? Jury says “no complaints were filed”… because nobody called the police.","Rival gang steals clients from scammer: “unfair competition”, complains a victim.","Crime syndicate announces “market share” and demands tribute from independent scammers.","Scammer declared dead on the Moon; death certificate “looks fake”, says clerk.","\"Sold-out\" Halloween party sold 3,000 tickets for a room that holds 200.","Online costume shop vanishes on the night of the 31st; customers get a real scare.","Experts remind us: the scariest thing about Halloween is still the card statement.","Black Friday: shop advertises €9 TVs; the only thing delivered was disappointment.","\"Parcel on hold\" texts hit a record: even people who bought nothing have one waiting.","\"Last day\" sale repeats for the 14th time this week.","Santa denies asking for bank details by text: \"I only work with reindeer.\"","\"Free\" Christmas hamper has already cost three delivery fees and still hasn't arrived.","Grandparents across the country get the same message: \"Hi, I changed my number.\""],"mg_t":"Mini-games","mg_d":"Quick breaks with rewards: connect cables to double your clicks, build the script for your next call and choose the victim before dialing.","mg_play":"Play","mg_cd":"Available in {t}","mg_cab_d":"Double clicks for a few seconds, plus some cash.","mg_gui_d":"More trust and pay on your next call.","mg_ld_d":"Choose the victim before every call.","mg_on":"On","mg_off":"Off","cb_t":"Connect the cables","cb_hint":"Tap a cable, then the socket with the same color and symbol. Every mistake costs time!","cb_err":"Short circuit! Wrong match.","cb_ok":"Connection restored! Double clicks for {n} s and +{x}.","cb_perfect":"No sparks! Perfect-wiring bonus.","cb_fail":"Time's up: the router rebooted by itself. Try again in a little while.","gs_t":"Build the script","gs_hint":"Tap the lines in the right order: opening, problem, pressure and ask. Some lines ruin everything!","gs_sheet":"Your sheet","gs_err":"Wrong order!","gs_res":["Script rejected: the boss tore up the sheet.","A weak script, but it will do.","A good script!","A perfect script!"],"gs_rdy":"Script ready {s}: gives an edge in your next call.","gs_have":"You already have a script ready. Use it in a call first.","gs_use":"Script {s}: +{p}% pay on this call.","gs_use2":"Script {s}: +1 trust and +{p}% pay on this call.","gs_tip":"Warning sign: almost every scam follows this order — win trust, invent a problem, create a rush and ask for money or a code. If a conversation fits this pattern, hang up and call the official number yourself.","gs_l":["Good morning, this is official tech support. We have an alert about your computer.","We detected a dangerous virus that is stealing your photos.","If we don't fix it right now, you'll lose everything today.","Just install our program and pay the 49-euro fee.","If you prefer, hang up and ask your tech-savvy grandson first.","Hello, my love. I've thought about you all day and I have to tell you something.","I'm stuck abroad and my card has been blocked.","You're the only person I trust. Please don't tell anyone.","Can you send me 800 euros in vouchers today? I'll pay you back on Friday.","If you prefer, we can wait and you can talk to your bank first.","Hi! I'm from your favorite influencer's team. You were chosen out of thousands.","You won a spot in the VIP group, but only two places are left.","There are already hundreds on the waiting list. Whoever hesitates loses their turn.","Make a small confirmation transfer and you're in right now.","You don't have to pay anything. It's all free, I swear.","Good morning, this is the finance director. I'm in a meeting and can't take calls.","I need an urgent transfer to close a confidential deal.","I've already spoken to the bank; all that's missing is your code authorization.","Send me the code you just received by SMS right now.","If you have doubts, call me on the company's official number.","Good afternoon. I have an exclusive opportunity, reserved for very few investors.","Our coin has already risen a thousand percent in three months. Charts don't lie.","The first investors are already millionaires; only the last spots remain.","Transfer your capital to the offshore account today and start earning tomorrow.","Read the contract calmly and compare other offers before you decide."],"ld_t":"Contact list","ld_d":"Choose who you want to talk to. The clues help, but they don't always tell the truth: suspicious people pay more, but one slip ends the call.","ld_rand":"Pick at random","ld_nm":["Mrs. Dolores","Mr. Arthur","Ms. Rosemary","Mr. Walter","Mrs. Patricia","Mr. Harold","Ms. Teresa","Mr. Clarence","Mrs. Edna","Mr. Gordon","Mrs. Grace","Mr. Albert"],"ld_c0":["Always picks up on the first ring.","Lives alone and loves a chat.","Has never heard of scams.","Says “yes” to everything to avoid being rude."],"ld_c1":["Asked for your tax ID before giving a name.","Records every call “for security”.","Works at a bank.","Has a nephew in the police fraud unit."],"ld_c2":["Listens, but asks a lot of questions.","Said to call back later… but picked up.","Is short on time, but hears you out.","Usually suspicious, but in a good mood today."],"ld_rev":["Profile: naive. Starts out trusting, but pays less.","Profile: suspicious. One slip ends the call, but pays more.","Profile: ordinary customer."],"cfg_ld":"Choose the victim before calling (contact list)","esc_t":"Emergency escape","esc_l":["Shredding the evidence…","Moving the clean money to your destination…","Saying goodbye to the team by text (no notice)…","Passing passport control with the most innocent face in the world…","Takeoff! Have a good trip, {name}. Destination: {to}."],"esc_sum":"Run summary","esc_r":["Duration","Total earned","Calls won","Seizures","Clean money","Keepsakes","Passports earned","Destination"],"esc_go":"Board the plane","esc_skip":"Skip","fin_t":"Last Call","fin_l":["{insp}'s ship is 3 minutes away… protocol “Last Call” started","moving the clean money to the lunar account… done","wiping servers, phone numbers and evidence… 100%","issuing a death certificate (fake)… cause: “excess of success”","creating a new identity: “Mr. Nobody”… done","planting a garden on the Moon… (the plants died, but the view is great)","connection closed. {insp} finds only an empty chair and a cactus."],"fin_h":"Mission accomplished","fin_r":["Total earned","Escapes","Calls won","Seizures","Keepsakes","Achievements","Clicks"],"fin_epi":"This was only a game. In real life, scams ruin people and end in court. If anyone asks you for money or codes in a hurry, be suspicious, hang up and talk to someone you trust. If you were a victim, report it.","fin_keep":"Keep playing","fin_view":"See the result","mu_ok":"The mule is free.","tl_cue":"(You hear a click… and a quiet laugh: “we're live, folks!”)","tl_live":"LIVE","tl_ok":"You hung up just in time! Rat instincts!","sk_t":"Talents","sk_d":"Each run you get talent points (3, plus 2 per passport). Spend them across the three branches: you can't have everything. Talents reset when you escape, so each run can be a different specialization.","sk_pts":"Free points: {a} / {b}","sk_rs":"Respec","sk_free":"free","sk_learn":"Learn ({c} 🎓)","sk_need":"You need {n} more talent points.","sk_rs_ok":"Talents reset. Choose again.","sk_hint":"You have {n} talent points to spend (Life tab → More → Talents).","sk_reset":"When you escape, this run's talents are lost, but next run you start with more points.","sk_warn":"This run's talents are lost when you escape (next run you pick others, with more points).","sk_info":"Three branches of 5 talents. In each branch you learn them in order, costing 1, 1, 2, 2 and 3 points. You have 3 points in your first run and 2 more per passport (maximum 13), so you must choose. Respeccing costs clean money (the first time each run is free). Talents add to the collection and the services.","sk_br":["Automation","Social engineering","Ghost"],"sk_brd":["Bots, phishing and passive income: the money works while you sleep.","Voices, scripts and bribes: earn more from every call and every person.","Wiped tracks: less police attention and smaller losses when they show up."],"sk_n":["Batch scripts","Bot network","Mass phishing","Rotating proxies","Sovereign botnet","Trustworthy voice","Polished script","Reading the victim","Cheap bribes","Golden voice","Anonymous browsing","Clean trail","Burner accounts","Digital fog","Ghost"],"sk_fx":["click attention","passive attention","trust needed per call","weak-spot hint chance"],"rv_t":"Rival syndicate","rv_d":"The rival is stealing your clients: the bigger his market share, the less automatic income you get.","rv_dd":"DDoS attack","rv_tr":"Pay tribute","rv_in":"{n} and his syndicate have entered your turf and are stealing your clients!","rv_hit":"Direct hit! His market share dropped. Attacks he can still take: {h}.","rv_down":"{n} is down! Loot: {x}.","rv_pay":"You paid {x} in tribute. The rival backs off for a few minutes.","rv_need":"You need {x} more dirty money for the attack.","rv_loss":"You lose {p}% of automatic income","rv_info":"From stage 7 on, a rival boss now and then invades your turf. His market share grows and takes a part of your automatic income (up to about a third). You can answer with a DDoS attack (dirty money): it cuts his share and health, but leaves a trail and raises police attention; after a few hits he goes down and you take his loot. Or pay him tribute (clean money): he backs off for a few minutes, with no defeat. If you beat him, the next rival comes back stronger. Rivals reset when you escape.","rv_nm":["Don Spam","Madame Phishing","Boris Botnet","The Bitcoin Baron","Scarlet Dragon"],"sp_t":"Special call","sp_new":"new!","sp_m":["Credibility","Patience","Alarm"],"sp_p1":"How do you approach the victim?","sp_p2":"How do you close the deal?","sp_ps":["unlikely","uncertain","likely"],"sp_cont":"Keep going","sp_noise":"🔊 Deafening noise! You can't click for 20 s.","sp_siren":"Police sirens are already wailing in the background… it was a trap all along.","sp_ff":["You know what? This doesn't smell right. I'll check with my bank and we'll see.","Wait a second… this doesn't add up. I'll talk to my family and get back to you.","Hmm, I'm not convinced. Send me everything in writing and I'll reply later.","Sorry, but I'd rather go and look into this in person. Good afternoon!"],"sp_fp":["Look, I don't have time for this. Goodbye!","That's enough of this conversation. Goodbye!","This is taking far too long. I'm hanging up."],"sp_fa":["This is a scam! I'm calling the police!","I get what this is now. I'm reporting this number!","I'm recording this call. Have a nice day!"],"cfg_sc":"Special calls with a story","sp_info":"Sometimes the victim is a special call, with a story of its own. You make two decisions: how you approach the person and how you close. The meters show 🤝 credibility (how much they believe you), 😤 patience (at 0 they hang up) and 🚨 alarm (at 100 they realize it's a scam). For the close, 🟢🟡🔴 shows the chance of working: the risky offer pays more. Winning pays like a normal call, with a story bonus. At the end you see the warning sign you used, so you can recognize it in real life. 📕 and ⚠️ show what you've already discovered (Black Book).","sp_1":{"n":"Mrs. Deolinda","ti":"Fake tech support","o":["Good afternoon, ma'am. This is John Smith from Windoze Global Enterprise in Lisbon. Your computer is broadcasting 47 Trojan horses straight into your street's power grid.","Good heavens! But I was only looking at chicken pie recipes…"],"a":[{"l":"Aggressive tech-babble","u":"Exactly, ma'am! The pies were corrupted by hackers from the other side of the world. I need you to find the Windoze key and press the letter R right now.","v":"The little window key? My grandson stuck a kitten sticker on top of it…"},{"l":"Threatening red tape","u":"If we don't fix this in 3 minutes, the digital traffic police will block your Internet access for three years.","v":"Police?! Don't call the police, young man! Tell me what to do!"},{"l":"Friendly technician","u":"Don't worry, granny. Your friend John will save the recipes. Look at the screen and tell me if you see letters moving on their own.","v":"I see a fly sitting on the screen. Does that count?"}],"b":[{"l":"Scary command","u":"Type “cmd” and press Enter. Tell me if the screen turned black as night.","v":"It went black, yes sir! It looks like the afterlife!","w":"Now type “tree” and pray until the green text stops scrolling."},{"l":"Losing your patience","u":"Mrs. Deolinda, for heaven's sake, don't click the Solitaire icon again!","v":"Don't shout at me. My grandson says everyone who shouts on the phone is a swindler from the market!"}],"ok":"Mrs. Deolinda types “tree”, sees the green text scrolling and allows remote access. The “repair” costs €199. The pies remain untouched.","tip":"No tech company calls you to warn about viruses. Never install programs or give remote access to your computer to someone who phones you."},"sp_2":{"n":"Mr. Rogério","ti":"The Baron's inheritance","o":["Dear Mr. Rogério, we are calling from the High Secretariat of Banking Compensation in Geneva. We hold a balance in your name worth 4.2 million euros, belonging to the late Baron Von Rogério.","A baron? My great-grandfather had a vegetable patch in Tomar, but I don't remember any castles. Isn't this one of those internet swindles?"],"a":[{"l":"Appeal to greed","u":"A swindle? If you prefer, we'll donate the 4.2 million to a charity and you can keep waking up at 6 a.m. to catch the bus.","v":"Hold on, friend! Nobody said anything about donating. Go on…"},{"l":"Absurd noble lineage","u":"Your great-grandfather bought noble titles while exporting kale to Monégasque royalty. All registered at the notary's office, with sealed wax.","v":"You know, the old man used to talk a lot about lands… So where is that money now?"},{"l":"Threat of an enforcement fine","u":"Ignoring this contact constitutes the crime of cross-border asset evasion, with a fine of up to €12,000.","v":"Fine, my foot! I'm going to the police station right now to ask about this!"}],"b":[{"l":"The Swiss tax seal","u":"To release the funds from Swiss custody, you only need to pay the Customs Clearance Fee of €350, in PayZafe cards.","v":"PayZafe? The Swiss bank uses cards from the tobacco shop?!","w":"It's the Swiss anonymity method, to dodge European Union taxes, Mr. Rogério. Do you want the 4 million or not?"},{"l":"Push your luck","u":"By the way, to speed things up and jump ahead of the other heirs, the rush fee is another €1,000. It's only valid today.","v":"Another thousand? Hmm… here's what I'll do: I'll sell the car and bring you everything at the tobacco shop!"}],"ok":"Mr. Rogério dashes to the gas station and buys every card on the shelf. The Baron, poor man, is still dead.","tip":"Prizes, inheritances and lotteries that demand an upfront payment are scams. Whoever has money to give you doesn't need to receive money first, and never in prepaid cards."},"sp_3":{"n":"Alexandre","ti":"The internet vigilante","o":["Congratulations! You've been picked to win an iFone 99 Ultra Max plated in gold, for your loyalty to the mobile network!","(shaky voice) Oh, how lovely! But listen… I use a rotary-dial phone from Telecabo, from 1996, plugged into the wall. Can I receive the mobile phone there?"],"a":[{"l":"Stick to the scam","u":"Absolutely! Just transfer €25 shipping costs via MB VAI right now.","v":"Certainly. Listen, could you spell out your IBAN while I play this tune on my recorder? (plays the recorder, off-key, at full blast)"},{"l":"Verify the identity","u":"Sir, a rotary phone doesn't have MB VAI. Can you give me your tax ID for validation?","v":"My tax ID is 123-456-SWINDLER. Hello, Tuitch chat, say hi to our operator!"}],"ok":"You hung up in time! Alexandre is left without a video and the Tuitch chat is left without a show.","ko":"You stayed on the line. Thousands of people heard everything live… and police sirens are already wailing in the background.","tip":"Prizes that ask for “shipping” or fees by transfer are scams. And if the conversation feels like a theater show (odd voices, absurd questions, noises), someone may be recording: hang up early."},"sp_4":{"n":"Mrs. Maria do Carmo","ti":"“Hi Mum”","o":["Mum? It's me… my phone fell in the café toilet and I'm calling from a temporary number from the school office. I need urgent help. Don't tell Dad!","Tiago?! Son, your voice sounds so deep… do you have a cold? Where are you?!"],"a":[{"l":"Confirm the name blindly","u":"Yes, I'm Tiago! I got caught in the rain at the bus stop. Mum, they'll cut me off from classes if I don't pay the tuition today by 5 p.m.!","v":"But Tiago… you're 38 years old and you work at a garage in Leiria!"},{"l":"The guilt trip","u":"I'm not Tiago, I'm your favorite son! How can a mother not recognize her own flesh and blood? That makes me sad…","v":"Oh, sorry, Bernardo! It's this hearing aid… Tell me, what happened?"},{"l":"Sound chaos","u":"(car horns) Mum, I was nearly run over by a scooter! I lost my wallet and my phone broke!","v":"My God, son! Are you hurt?! Tell me what I need to do!"}],"b":[{"l":"Quick MB VAI","u":"Send €890 via MB VAI to this contact before the office closes.","v":"It says the recipient is “Vasco Burlas Ltd.”…","w":"That's the name of the university's dean, Mum!"},{"l":"The café ATM","u":"Go to the café's ATM, choose “Pay Services”, entity 12345, and enter €890. I'll stay on the line.","v":"I'm going, son! Just let me take off my apron…"}],"ok":"Mrs. Maria do Carmo pays the €890 with her apron still on, right there in the middle of the street. Tiago is still in Leiria, clueless.","tip":"If someone claims to be a relative and changes number, be suspicious: call the old number or ask a question only they would know. Never transfer money in a hurry."},"sp_5":{"n":"Dr. Vítor","ti":"Fake tax office","o":["General Directorate of Taxes and Asset Fraud Enforcement. Executive notice 404-B: you have 12 minutes to settle the asset discrepancy, or your accounts will be frozen.","Who am I speaking with? My income tax return was already validated and closed, with no additional assessment!"],"a":[{"l":"Quote made-up articles","u":"We are acting under Article 94-Bis of the European Union Regulation on Obscure Operations. Did you declare your speculative capital purchases?","v":"Article 94-Bis? Was that published in the Official Gazette last week…?"},{"l":"Threat of public scandal","u":"We have two uniformed agents and a van outside your office. Do you really want to watch computers being carried out in boxes in front of your clients?","v":"Wait! Don't make a scene in the building, I'll deal with it right now!"},{"l":"Friendly help","u":"Doctor, I know you're an exemplary professional. I'm here to help you sort this out discreetly, just between the two of us.","v":"Thank goodness someone sensible called me! Tell me, what do I need to do?"}],"b":[{"l":"Emergency settlement","u":"To suspend the enforcement, settle the provisional payment slip of €1,250 now, using the firm's prepaid card.","v":"The tax office accepts rechargeable virtual cards?!","w":"It's the European Central Bank's new accelerated anti-fraud protocol. Pay up, or the agents ring your doorbell."},{"l":"Exploit the panic","u":"Doctor, with late-payment interest the amount has already gone up to €2,500. Pay it all now and your name will never appear anywhere.","v":"Two thousand five hundred?! Fine, fine… but please don't let the neighbors see the agents!"}],"ok":"Dr. Vítor pays up, terrified, to protect his reputation. The firm's prepaid card is left without a cent.","tip":"Tax authorities never threaten you by phone or ask for payment in prepaid cards. If someone calls in the name of an authority, hang up and contact them yourself through official channels."},"sp_6":{"n":"António","ti":"Love at sea","o":["(soft voice) My dear António… I finally got a satellite signal. The waves are high, but I can only think of our meeting in Cascais.","My dearest Tatiana! My angel! When does the ship dock? I've already bought the wine and the cheese tarts!"],"a":[{"l":"The Navy fee","u":"António, the captain will only let me disembark with my pension if I pay the fuel deposit at the port. It's €400…","v":"But doesn't the Navy pay for the diesel, darling?","w":"The government froze everything because of the military crisis! Do you want me stuck at sea forever?"},{"l":"Immediate promise","u":"If you pay the speedboat fee, I'll be at your door tonight at 9 p.m. with all my suitcases.","v":"Tonight?! I'll go change the sheets and set the table for two right away!"},{"l":"Threaten to vanish","u":"Darling, the signal is about to drop and I don't know when I'll get satellite again. If we don't sort this out today, you may never hear from me again.","v":"No, no, don't hang up, Tatiana! Just tell me what I need to do!"}],"b":[{"l":"Digital vouchers","u":"The captain only accepts €50 Pear Store cards, because the ship's system is all American. I need eight.","v":"Phone store cards? Tatiana, that's very strange…","w":"So our love isn't worth eight cards? If you'd rather keep your money, I'll stay here at sea, in the cold!"},{"l":"Push your luck","u":"By the way, my love, the disembarkation permit costs another €800. Just this once, and then we're together forever.","v":"Another eight hundred? My kids say I'm a fool… but love has no price! I'm off to the bank right now!"}],"ok":"António rushes to the store, crying with emotion, and buys all the cards. “Tatiana” is actually a man named Boris, in a rented attic, with no boat whatsoever.","tip":"An online love who never shows up on video, is always in trouble and ends up asking for money or gift cards is a scam. No one who truly loves you asks for prepaid cards."},"sp_7":{"n":"Nuno","ti":"Crypto mentor","o":["Hey, champ! This is the mentor of the VIP Quantum Arbitrage Alpha team. We saw you want to escape the rat race. Ready to bank €3,000 a day while you sleep?","Hey, bro! Yeah, I saw the stories with the Lambo! But look, this month I've only got my unemployment benefit…"],"a":[{"l":"Motivational shaming","u":"And you want to keep a wage-slave mindset? Whoever doesn't risk tomorrow's lunch won't eat caviar the day after, kid!","v":"You're so right! I'm sick of being an NPC in real life!"},{"l":"Quantum jargon","u":"The bot uses quantum AI from the Universal Space Agency, with 500× leverage. There's no risk, because it predicts the chart candles before they open.","v":"Does it have a stop-loss on the blockchain?","w":"It has stop-loss, a firewall and hyperbolic liquidity. Just press the green button."},{"l":"Social proof","u":"Look at my students' screenshots, bro! Zé Pedro paid off his car in two weeks. Have you seen our VIP group?","v":"Wow, Zé Pedro? The one who used to fall asleep in class? If he can do it, so can I!"}],"b":[{"l":"Urgent deposit","u":"Create an account on “guaranteed-profit-super-safe.biz” and deposit €500 with your card. Spots close at midnight.","v":"My bank says the site has been reported for fraud…","w":"That's the traditional banking system trying to block your wealth, bro! Don't let the system win!"},{"l":"Raise the stakes","u":"For those with real guts, there's the Diamond plan: deposit €1,500 and the bot multiplies it tenfold by Friday. Only two get in per day.","v":"Fifteen hundred? I've only got my benefit, but I'll borrow from my cousin and my aunt… I want Diamond, bro!"}],"ok":"Nuno transfers his whole benefit on the spot, smiling. The site disappears at three in the morning. The Lambo, by the way, was rented.","tip":"Nobody can guarantee profits without risk: promises of “easy money”, pressure to deposit fast and mentors who only appear in stories are signs of a scam. Always check that the platform is authorized by the financial regulator."},"sp_8":{"n":"Mr. Joaquim","ti":"Free solar panels","o":["Congratulations, Mr. Joaquim! You've been selected by the European Green Transition Plan to receive 12 solar panels 100% funded by non-repayable grants.","For free? The government giving things away? Here in the village nobody gives anything without asking for double afterwards…"],"a":[{"l":"Fear of the green tax","u":"It's not the government, it's direct funds from Brussels. Anyone who refuses gets hit with an €80 carbon footprint fee on their electricity bill.","v":"A fee, my foot! I already pay enough sewage and garbage fees!"},{"l":"Neighbor envy","u":"Your neighbor across the road, Mr. Manuel, has already signed and will start selling energy to the grid next week.","v":"Manuel?! That deadbeat gets it for free and I don't? Put the papers in my name right now!"},{"l":"Official letter","u":"The file has a number, a seal and a stamp. An official letter has already been sent to your address: you only have to confirm the details with me.","v":"A letter with a stamp? Then it must be serious. Ask what you need to know, I'm listening."}],"b":[{"l":"Roof-tile fall insurance","u":"The van comes tomorrow at 9 a.m. You only need to transfer the roof-tile-fall insurance deposit: €150.","v":"If it's free, why do I pay for the falling tile first?","w":"It's a European safe-work rule, Mr. Joaquim. The technician hands you back the €150 in person as soon as he climbs the ladder."},{"l":"Push your luck","u":"By the way, to put panels on the upper roof you need a certified scaffold. That's another €250, and the technician brings everything the same day.","v":"Scaffolding too? Fine, I'll pay it all at once, so they don't bother me again."}],"ok":"Mr. Joaquim pays and sits on the wall, beret on his head, waiting for the phantom van. Three days go by and it never arrives.","tip":"“Free” programs that make you pay first (deposits, insurance, fees) are scams. No official support scheme asks for money by phone: always check on the official websites or with your local council."},"cfg_or":"Screen orientation","or_n":["Automatic","Portrait","Landscape"],"or_d":"Automatic follows your phone (and its rotation lock).","rot_auto":"Play like this (automatic)","nt_today":"today at {h}","nt_tom":"tomorrow at {h}","nt_next":"Next reminder: {w}","nt_why":"It only reminds you when there's a daily reward to collect: if you already got today's, the next reminder is tomorrow.","nt_test":"Test the reminder (in 1 min)","nt_test_ok":"Test scheduled: the reminder arrives in about 1 minute, even with the game closed.","nt_test_t":"🔔 Test: SCAM Operator reminders are working.","nt_batt":"If the test doesn't arrive with the game closed, your phone is blocking the app: in the app settings, under Battery, choose “Unrestricted”.","nt_app":"Open app settings","and_back":"Press Back again to exit","col_galo":"Golden Barcelos Rooster","col_galo_d":"Full collection prize: +5% to clicks, income and calls.","col_galo_l":"{n} pieces to go. Complete the collection to win it (+5% to clicks, income and calls).","col_galo_i":"With all 36 pieces you win the Golden Barcelos Rooster.","cfg_gfx":"Images (pixel-art drawings)","cfg_gfx_d":"Turn off to go back to emojis (lighter on older phones).","rl_last":"Last spins","cc_tap":"Tap here to open the chat","th_t":"Window theme","th_d":"New themes unlock with achievements and during seasonal events. High contrast always takes priority over the theme.","th_n":{"auto":"Automatic (like your phone)","w95":"Classic Windows 95","noite":"Windows 95 at night","w98":"Windows 98","hacker":"Hacker terminal","vapor":"Vaporwave","abobora":"Pumpkin","bf":"Black Friday","natal":"Christmas"},"th_la":"{h}/{n} achievements","th_le":"Event: {e}","th_new":"Theme unlocked: {n}!","th_tap":"Tap to pick it in Settings → Comfort","ev_hw_n":"Halloween","ev_bf_n":"Black Friday","ev_xm_n":"Christmas","ev_until":"until {d}","ev_goal":"Win {n} seasonal calls","ev_rw":"reward: {th} theme + 3 🎟️","ev_got":"Event complete: reward collected!","ev_prog":"Seasonal calls: {n}/{m}","ev_done":"{e} event complete! +3 🎟️ and the «{th}» theme unlocked.","ev_start":"The {e} event has started! Until {d}, some calls are seasonal and pay more.","ev_hw_v":["Oh, is this about the Halloween party tickets? I saw the ad on Instagram and they said they're almost sold out!","Is this the costume shop? I ordered the vampire costume at 70% off and it still hasn't arrived…","Are you calling about the candy giveaway? They told me I won a €500 hamper just for sharing the post!"],"ev_hw_f":["Tickets sold by strangers on social media are classic bait: only buy through the event's official channels.","Shops that appeared a few days ago, with huge discounts and no contact details you can check, are usually fake: look for reviews before paying.","Giveaways that ask you to share, hand over your details or pay \"shipping\" to get the prize are scams."],"ev_bf_v":["Is this the shop with 90% off TVs? I already paid by bank transfer like they asked, but the order never shows up.","I got a text saying my parcel is held and I have to pay €1.99. Is that you?","Are you calling about the €500 Black Friday voucher I got on WhatsApp? I just have to enter my card details, right?"],"ev_bf_f":["Prices that are too good to be true and payment only by bank transfer are signs of a fake shop: use payment methods with buyer protection.","Couriers and the post office don't ask for payments by text message with links: go to the official website yourself to track the parcel.","Vouchers and coupons that arrive by message and ask for your card details are there to steal those details."],"ev_xm_v":["Is this about the donation for the children? I already sent €50 to the phone number in the message.","Are you calling about the supermarket's Christmas hamper? I just need to pay the delivery fee, right?","Is that you, my grandson? They told me you changed your number and need money for the presents…"],"ev_xm_f":["Before donating, check the charity through its official channels: urgent requests by message to mobile numbers are suspicious.","Prizes and hampers that require a fee before delivery are scams: a real prize is never paid for.","\"I changed my number, I need money\": call the old number you know before sending anything."],"nx_t":"Other reminders (optional)","nx_m_cb":"Unfinished daily missions (at 7 pm)","nx_j_cb":"When Jorge is waiting for your answer","nx_e_cb":"When a seasonal event starts","nx_note":"Each reminder is scheduled on your phone; nothing is sent over the internet.","nx_ok":"Reminder on.","nx_m1":"📋 You still have daily missions to do ({n}/3).","nx_m2":"📋 New missions are waiting for you.","nx_j":"💬 Jorge is still waiting for your answer.","nx_e":"The {e} event has started in SCAM Operator!","up_t":"Updates","up_ver":"Game version: {v} · app: {a}","up_auto":"Check for and prepare updates automatically","up_btn":"Check now","up_chk":"Checking…","up_down":"Downloading the new version… {p}%","up_ready":"Version {v} is ready.","up_tap":"Tap to update now (or it will apply next time you open the game)","up_apply":"Update now","up_none":"You already have the latest version.","up_apk":"There is a new app version ({v}). Install the new APK to get it.","up_err":"Couldn't check right now (no internet?). Try again later.","up_last":"Last check: {d}","up_note":"New versions come from GitHub Pages and are verified before they are used. Nothing of yours is sent and your saved games stay as they are.","cfg_j":"Saved games","cfg_jd":"Your games are saved on this phone (up to 3). To move one to another device, use the transfer code.","cfg_jov":"Replace the game in slot {n} with the current game?","cfg_nt":"Reminders","on5":"on","off5":"off","an_cb":"Help improve the game (anonymous statistics)","an_what":"What is sent?","an_t":"Anonymous statistics","an_d":"If you turn this on, the game sends a few game numbers now and then, to help understand where it is too hard, too easy or boring:\n• the stage and jurisdiction you reach, the difficulty and your play time;\n• escapes, police seizures and how long sessions last;\n• the game version, the language and whether you play in the app or in a browser;\n• how many calls you win (for the community goal).\n\nYour name, the operator name, accounts, contacts and any phone identifier are never sent, and the server does not store your IP address. It is off by default and you can turn it off at any time.","an_ask":"Want to help improve SCAM Operator? If you agree, the game sends anonymous statistics now and then (stage, play time, difficulty, language). Nothing identifies you, and you can turn it off in Settings → General → Privacy and my data.","an_ok":"Thanks! Anonymous statistics on.","an_off":"Anonymous statistics off.","an_priv":"Privacy policy","tip_boss":"The Boss:","tip_flag":"Red flag:","bt_bios":["Memory: 640 KB … OK","Looking for burner phones … 3 found","Neighbour’s Wi-Fi … connected","Loading SCAMOS.SYS …"],"bt_pres":"presents","bt_load":"Starting up…","bt_files":"Loading images {a}/{b}","bt_skip":"Tap to skip","bt_t":"Start-up screen","bt_n":["Full","Short","Off"],"cine_l":["Lisbon. Three in the morning.","No job, no money, and the neighbour’s Wi-Fi.","A new message lands in the inbox…","What if I were the one writing these messages?","The phone rings. Unknown number."],"cine_mail":"Dear friend, I am an exiled prince and I need your help to move an inheritance…","cine_rw":"Watch the intro","chap_w":"CHAPTER {n}","map_t":"On the way to {j}…","bye_t":"It’s now safe to turn off your computer.","bye_back":"Tap to switch it back on","bye_b":"Shut down","cred_b":"Credits","cred_x":"Close","cred_l":["#SCAM Operator","A game by Alize.On.Me","","#Idea and direction","Alize.On.Me","#Music","Mix chiptune","#Languages","Português · English · Español · 中文 · Français · Deutsch · Русский","#Testing","Alize.On.Me · Padesko · Hoodz · Glxckx","","#Operator of the month","{name}","","No real victims were scammed during the making of this game.","","Remember: rush, secrecy and easy money are always red flags.","","Thanks for playing!"],"ss_t":"Screen saver","ss_n":["Random","Pipes","Stars","Logo"],"ss_try":"Try it","dsc_t":"Before you start","dsc_1":"SCAM Operator is a satire: it shows how scams work so you learn to recognise them. Everything that happens in the game is made up.","dsc_2":"The game will never ask you for real details: your real name, cards, codes, passwords or money. If anyone asks for them in the game’s name, it’s a scam.","dsc_3":"The card numbers in the calls are fake (0000 1111…). Each stage ends with a real red flag to take with you.","dsc_ok":"Got it","sv_full":"Couldn’t save the game: the browser/app storage is full. Delete a slot you no longer use.","sv_nobak":"There is no backup of this slot.","sv_restq":"The game in slot {n} looks damaged. Restore the backup from {d}?","sv_rest":"Slot {n} restored.","sv_bad":"damaged","sv_fix":"Restore the backup of slot {n}","sv_note":"Every saved game is checked when it opens, and a copy of the last good save is kept (every {m} minutes).","ex_warn":"This code IS your game. Don’t share it or send it to anyone who asks for it: that’s exactly what a scammer would do.","fl_t":"File","fl_d":"Save the game to a file (your own backup) or open a file you saved before.","fl_save":"Save file","fl_open":"Open file","fl_ok":"File saved.","fl_err":"Couldn’t use the file.","nm_warn":"Don’t use your real name: this name may appear on the public leaderboard.","cas_cb":"Casino","cas_d":"Turn off to hide the casino (pretend gambling, no real money). With a PIN, only someone who knows it can turn it back on.","pin_t":"PIN","pin_ask":"Enter the 4-digit PIN.","pin_new":"New PIN (4 digits):","pin_rep":"Repeat the PIN:","pin_fmt":"The PIN must have 4 digits.","pin_diff":"The PINs don’t match.","pin_bad":"Wrong PIN.","pin_ok":"PIN saved on this device.","pin_off":"PIN removed.","pin_set":"Protect with a PIN","pin_chg":"Change PIN","pin_rm":"Remove PIN","brk_c":"Break reminder","brk_t":"How about a break?","brk_b":"You’ve been playing for {n} minutes straight. Stand up, drink some water, look out of the window. The business keeps earning while you’re away.","ver_upd":"Version {v} downloaded and verified: digital signature and files checked before use.","ver_apk":"Version {v} built into the app, signed by the developer.","ver_key":"Key: {k}","pv_none":"The policy didn’t come with this version. Open it online:","pv_web":"View online","pv_off":"works offline","my_t":"Privacy and my data","my_sub":"what stays, what’s sent, delete","my_d":"The game has no accounts and asks for no personal data. Here you can see what stays on this device and what goes online, and delete it.","my_dev":"On this device","my_dev_d":"{n} saved game(s), backups, achievements and settings: about {k} KB. They never leave (unless you export the code).","my_rk_d":"When you win a run, the operator name, money, time and escapes go to the public leaderboard. You can delete your entries here.","my_rk_none":"You haven’t sent any score from this device yet.","my_delq":"Ask to delete this entry from the online leaderboard?","my_deld":"Entry deleted from the leaderboard.","my_old":"This entry was sent by an old version and doesn’t carry this device’s key. Write to the email below and we’ll delete it by hand.","my_derr":"Couldn’t delete it now (no internet?). Try again later.","my_an_q":"Waiting to be sent: {n} event(s).","my_an_v":"See exactly what will be sent","my_an_c":"Clear the queue","my_an_cd":"Queue cleared.","my_mail":"Questions or requests about your data:","tut_1":"👆 Tap here to work. Every tap makes money (pretend money, of course).","tut_2":"💰 This is your balance. Below it: how much you earn per second without lifting a finger.","tut_3":"🛒 You can afford some equipment. Open the Shop.","tut_4":"Buy your first item: some boost each tap, others earn on their own.","tut_5":"🚨 Police attention rises with every tap. At 100% you get caught and lose part of your dirty money. It goes down on its own over time.","tut_6":"📞 The phone is free: make a call. Pick your tactics well, and at the end you’ll see the real red flag.","tut_7":"⬆️ You can afford the next stage: you’ll earn a lot more per tap.","tut_8":"🎁 Here are the daily reward, missions and scratch cards. Good luck (and remember: in the real world, always be suspicious)!","tut_ok":"Got it","tut_skip":"Skip tutorial","tut_off":"Tutorial skipped. You can replay it in Settings → Comfort.","tut_end":"Tutorial done. You’ll figure out the rest as you play!","tut_again":"Replay the tutorial","tut_on":"Tutorial on: follow the hints on screen.","dlt_t":"Colour-blind colours","dlt_n":["Normal","Red-green","Blue-yellow"],"ach_q":"Search achievements","ach_f":["All","Done","To do","Secret"],"ach_none":"No achievements match that filter.","ico_cb":"App icon changes during events","ico_d":"The switch happens when you leave the game. Note: some phones remove the icon from the home screen when it changes (it always stays in the app list).","up_rev":"This game version was withdrawn. Next time you open the app, it goes back to the built-in version.","fam_n":["The tech-savvy grandson","The lawyer daughter","The neighbour","The granddaughter","The son-in-law","The ex-banker uncle","Grandma's best friend","The family dog"],"fam_l":["Hello? This is the grandson. My grandmother doesn't install any programs. Who is this?","Good afternoon, I'm the daughter and I'm a lawyer. Repeat your full name and your company number.","Give me that, dear! Who are you? I know everyone on this street.","Grandma, it's a scam! I'm recording, sir. Say hi to my followers.","Who's bothering my mother-in-law? Give me your address and I'll come over.","I worked thirty years in a bank. No bank asks for that over the phone. Explain yourself.","Hang up, dear! My nephew fell for that last month!","Woof! Woof woof! WOOF!"],"fam_hint":"👪 {n} grabbed the phone! Hang up and lose nothing, or try to convince them (harder: one mistake and it's over).","fam_hang":"📵 Hang up","fam_push":"🗣️ Try to convince","fam_bye":"The family protected her. In real life, talking to someone you trust stops most scams.","fam_won":"Not even the family stopped you… In real life, when the family steps in, the scam almost always ends there.","loc_tag":"📍 Local victim: pays +20%.","loc_n":["Mrs Amália, a fado singer in a black shawl","Uncle Zé, a fisherman from Nazaré","Captain Ortega, canal pilot","Mrs Rosário, weaves straw hats","Brad, yacht broker","Kim, diving instructor","Mr Moreau, tortoise keeper","Mrs Nalini, vanilla farmer","Pierre, casino croupier","Mr Velozzi, retired racing driver","Gaspar, lunar miner","Zork, tourist from another planet","Pixel_Queen, avatar with a neon crown","Bruno_3D, sells virtual land","Dr Byte, server engineer","Sofia, virtual assistant"],"loc_h":["Hello… sorry, I was rehearsing a fado. It's about longing and unpaid bills.","Go on, go on, I have the net drying and sardines on the grill!","Captain speaking. I have a container ship waiting, be quick.","Hello! I'm finishing a hat, but go on. My hands are busy and my ears are free.","Brad. If it's not about yachts, you have thirty seconds.","I just came out of a dive. Talk slowly, I'm still decompressing.","Good morning. I have a 150-year-old tortoise here. She's faster than my bank.","Hello! Everything smells of vanilla here. How can I help?","Place your bets… sorry, force of habit. Go on.","Ready! Talk fast, I still think at 300 km/h.","Hello… *beep*… can you hear me? The helmet has static. I've been breaking rocks for twelve hours.","Greetings, earthling! I came to visit the Earth, but I only have a view of it.","Hello, mortal! I'm at a virtual party. My avatar cost more than my house.","Go on. I have virtual land next to the virtual shop of a virtual singer.","I'm rebooting a server. You have thirty seconds of my attention.","Hello! I'm a virtual assistant. How can I help you today?"],"loc_g":["What a lovely fado you sing. Here: 0000 1111 2222 3333, CVV 123.","All right, mate. The card is 0000 1111 2222 3333, CVV 123. Fancy some sardines?","Understood. Card 0000 1111 2222 3333, CVV 123. Over and out.","How kind. There: 0000 1111 2222 3333, CVV 123. Would you like a hat?","Deal closed. Card 0000 1111 2222 3333, CVV 123. Next!","Fine… 0000 1111 2222 3333, CVV 123. I'm going back in the water.","Very well: 0000 1111 2222 3333, CVV 123. Don't tell the tortoise.","Such a sweet talk. There: 0000 1111 2222 3333, CVV 123.","All bets are placed. Card 0000 1111 2222 3333, CVV 123.","Green flag! 0000 1111 2222 3333, CVV 123.","OK… 0000 1111 2222 3333, CVV 123… *beep*","Intergalactic payment authorised: 0000 1111 2222 3333, CVV 123. This is money, right?","I'll buy! 0000 1111 2222 3333, CVV 123. Can I pay in likes too?","Done: 0000 1111 2222 3333, CVV 123. Virtual neighbours, virtual friends.","Hmm… OK. 0000 1111 2222 3333, CVV 123. This won't end up in the logs, will it?","Request processed: 0000 1111 2222 3333, CVV 123. Is there anything else I can help with?"],"loc_f":["That smells like a badly sung fado. I'm hanging up, dear.","That's fishmonger talk. I'm off to sea, bye!","Negative. That won't get through the lock. Hanging up.","That's badly woven. No, thank you.","Bad deal. Next!","That has more sharks than the reef. Bye!","The tortoise shook her head. I trust her. Goodbye.","That's too sweet to be true. No, thank you.","No more bets. The house always wins, and today I'm the house.","Red flag. That's a trap. Box, box!","No signal… and no patience. *beep*","On my planet that's called a scam. I'm teleporting away. Bye!","That looks so 2021. Blocked!","I'm the one who sells land that doesn't exist. No competition, thanks!","I saw your number in the fraud logs. Already reported. Good day.","Sorry, I can't help with that. This conversation has been reported."],"fin7_t":"End of the line","fin7_l":["{insp} cut access to the Metaverse and the Cloud… 3 servers left","deleting avatars, bots and cloned voices… 100%","searching for somewhere to run… no results","analysing options… there is always an honest way out","final decision pending…"],"fin7_q":"You have reached the end of the internet. What now?","fin7_c":"🤝 Turn myself in and switch sides","fin7_s":"🐓 Switch everything off (secret ending)","fin7_k":"▶ Keep playing (I'll decide later)","fin7_lock":"🔒 Secret ending: finish without a single raid or complete the collection (golden Rooster of Barcelos).","fin_next":"🛸 The Moon is not the end: escape again and enter the Metaverse.","cert_t":"Career Certificate","cert_h":"This certifies that","cert_b":"completed the operator career with the \"{e}\" ending.","cert_e":["The Last Call (Moon)","Anti-scam consultant","Gone fishing (secret)"],"cert_note":"This certificate has no legal value at all. Just like your business.","cert_tip":"In real life: be suspicious, hang up and check through another channel.","cert_btn":"📜 Certificate","cert_none":"You have no ending yet. Win a run on the Moon to get your certificate.","d_rw":"🎬 Watch again","vox":"🗣️ 8-bit voices in calls","typing":"typing…","chn_mail":"Email","chn_sms":"Text","chn_soc":"Social media","chn_msg":"Messages","chn_mkt":"Marketplace","ret_w":"📕 This victim fell for it once before. This time they were warned: the tactic that worked last time now backfires.","ret_n":"📕 This victim fell for it once before. This time they answer with their grandson beside them, listening.","ret_hw":["You again?! Last time I lost my savings. This time I will be careful.","Oh, I remember this voice. My daughter explained everything to me after last time.","I went to the police about a call just like this one. Go on, but slowly."],"ret_hn":["Wait, my grandson is right here. He understands these things.","I'll put you on speaker, my grandson wants to hear.","My grandson told me never to answer numbers like this… but fine, go ahead."],"cmb_n":["Rushed heart","Badge and threat","Secret deal","Race against time","Confidant","Official refund"],"cmb_l":["First they win your trust, then they don't let you think.","An «authority» that threatens you is the most common combination in phone scams.","Guaranteed profit that must stay secret: that way nobody can warn you in time.","Fear and hurry together switch off reasoning. Hang up and call the official number yourself.","Someone friendly who asks for secrecy wants to cut you off from the people who would protect you.","Official bodies don't call to offer you money. A «refund» over the phone is bait."],"cmb_new":"Combo discovered: {n}! +1 🤝","cmb_hit":"{n}: +1 🤝","cmb_t":"🔗 Tactic combos ({n}/6)","cmb_d":"Some tactics work better in a row: each combo gives +1 trust. In real life, they are the strongest warning signs.","cmb_q":"❔ ??? → ???","l2_ring":"📞 Line 2 is ringing…","l2_take":"⏸️ Put on hold and answer","l2_skip":"📵 Ignore line 2","l2_hold":"{n} is on hold.","l2_swap":"Switch to {n} (waiting {k}/{m})","l2_back":"Back to {n}","l2_res":"You're back on the call.","l2_bye":"📵 {n} got tired of waiting and hung up.","rs_t":"Call summary","rs_bad":"Got suspicious at line {n}, when you used «{x}».","rs_why":["The hurry made them stop: anyone with time to think distrusts 10-minute deadlines.","They wanted to check who you were. A real bank or police officer never minds if you hang up and call the official number.","The threats sounded over the top: real organisations don't threaten anyone over the phone.","The profit was too good to be true, and they knew it.","So much friendliness from a stranger made them wary.","Asking for secrecy set off the alarm: whoever asks for secrecy doesn't want anyone to warn you."],"rs_ok":"Never suspected a thing: «{x}» was this victim's weak spot. In real life, be wary of anyone who tells you exactly what you want to hear.","rs_slow":"The victim didn't get suspicious, but the conversation dragged on and they hung up.","rs_sus0":"The victim was already suspicious: someone had warned them.","rs_ret":"The victim was warned after the last scam: the tactic that worked before became an alarm.","gv_t":"🎭 Scam for this stage","gv_info":"In every stage you can choose between two scams. The classic one is the stage's own. The alternative changes what you earn and how much police attention you get: some are discreet, others risky. Switch whenever you like.","gv_a":"Classic","gv_r":["🤫 Discreet","⚖️ Balanced","🔥 Risky"],"gv_sig":"⚠️ Warning sign","gv_on":"Scam: {n}","gvx":[{"n":"Hi Mum, New Number","a":"Text «mum, this is my new number»","s":"A message from an unknown number pretending to be a son or daughter in trouble. It pays a lot, but complaints arrive fast.","t":"If a relative writes from a new number asking for money, call their old number or ask something only they would know."},{"n":"Payment Request","a":"Send payment requests","s":"You pose as a buyer on a second-hand site and, instead of paying, send a payment request. Small amounts each time, almost nobody complains.","t":"To receive money you never have to accept requests or go to a cash machine. If they ask you to «receive» at a cash machine, it's a scam."},{"n":"Fake Courier","a":"Ring doorbells with a card terminal","s":"A courier at the door charges a «€2 customs fee» on a card terminal… that copies the card.","t":"Be wary of fees charged at the door. Check on the courier's official website and never hand your card to anyone."},{"n":"Fake Tickets","a":"Sell sold-out tickets","s":"Tickets for the concert of the year and the big match, sold on social media. The tickets don't exist.","t":"Only buy tickets from official channels. Sellers on social media who only take instant transfers are classic bait."},{"n":"Code Sent by Mistake","a":"Ask for «the code I sent you by mistake»","s":"A «friend» asks for the 6-digit code that arrived by text. With it, you steal the messaging account and ask the contacts for money.","t":"Never share codes you receive by text, not even with friends. Turn on two-step verification in messaging apps."},{"n":"Electricity Refund","a":"Send «you paid your bill twice»","s":"An email identical to the electricity company's promises to refund a bill paid twice. Just «confirm your card».","t":"Real refunds don't ask for card details. Log into the customer area yourself through the official website or app."},{"n":"Supermarket Voucher","a":"Spread the «€500 voucher»","s":"A fake survey promises a shopping voucher to anyone who answers and shares it with 10 friends. Little money, lots of data.","t":"Prizes that ask you to share with friends and give personal data are data harvesting. Brands don't hand out €500 for a survey."},{"n":"Government Benefit","a":"Send «you have a benefit to collect»","s":"A text in the name of Social Security: a €300 benefit is waiting, just confirm your bank details today.","t":"Government services don't ask for bank details by text with links. Always check on the official portal, typing the address yourself."}],"mo_q":"📩 The victim calls back, crying:","mo_h":["Wait… that was the money for my medicine.","It was for this month's rent. Now I don't know what to do.","I saved that for two years for my grandson's glasses.","It was the money for the trip to see my daughter.","I'm a student… it was all I had for the month.","It was my funeral savings. I didn't want to be a burden on anyone."],"mo_give":"💸 Give the money back ({x})","mo_keep":"🙈 Keep it","mo_thx":"You gave it back?! I don't know who you are, but bless you!","mo_cry":"Beep-beep-beep… they hung up in tears.","mo_gave":"You gave back {x}. Police attention goes down.","cert_rf":"Money given back","trc_btn":"🎓 See the certificate","trc_t":"Scam Detector","trc_h":"This certifies that","trc_b":"got {c} out of {m} questions right in the anti-scam training and can spot the warning signs.","trc_lv":["Apprentice","Detector","Senior Detector","Anti-Scam Master"],"trc_lvl":"Level: {l} · {n} correct answers in total","trc_copy":"📋 Copy to share","trc_copied":"✅ Copied! You can paste it into a message now.","trc_txt":"🛡️ I'm a «{l}» in SCAM Operator's anti-scam training: I got {c} out of {m}. Tip: {d}","trc_min":"Get at least {n} out of {m} in a round to earn the Scam Detector certificate.","sch_cb":"📚 School mode","sch_d":"No casino, no scratch cards and no online leaderboard. Each new stage shows its warning sign and training is one tap away in the Work tab. Applies to all saves.","sch_tag":"📚 School mode on","sch_lock":"📚 Not available in school mode.","sch_tr":"🎓 Anti-scam training","hr_n":["late night","morning","afternoon","evening"],"hr_a":["late at night","in the morning","in the afternoon","in the evening"],"hr_t":"Victim schedules","hr_w0":"Now: {p} · anyone who answers at this hour is suspicious","hr_w1":"Now: {p} · a good time for {v}","hr_w2":"Now: {p} · {v} answers best {b}","hr_good":"Perfect timing! The victim is relaxed: +1 trust and pays 15 % more.","hr_bad":"Bad timing: this victim answers best {b}. You need 1 more trust.","hr_late":"\"Who calls at this hour?\" The victim answers suspicious.","hr_bk":"Best times","hr_info":"The game uses your phone's clock: late night (0–7 h), morning (7–12 h), afternoon (12–19 h) and evening (19–24 h). Each victim has a favourite time. At the right time they start with +1 trust and pay 15 % more. At the wrong time you need 1 more trust. Late at night they answer suspicious. In real life, scammers pick their moment too: they call when you are tired, in a hurry or distracted. If someone calls at an odd hour asking for money or codes, hang up.","lk_t":"Data leaks","lk_n":["Names and phones","Bank details","Full package"],"lk_d":["+1 trust","+1 and the weak spot","+2 trust"],"lk_ok":"List bought: {n}. Good for {c} calls in this stage.","lk_act":"Active list: {n} · {a} of {b} calls left","lk_use":"The list helps: you already know who the victim is (+{n} trust, more police attention).","lk_use1":"The list has the bank details: +1 trust and the weak spot goes into the Black Book 📕.","lk_fake":"The list was fake! A rival sold you numbers that no longer exist. It's gone.","lk_sig":"In real life, lists of stolen data are sold between scammers. That is why a scammer may know your name, your bank or your number. Knowing your details does not prove the call is real: hang up and call the official number yourself.","lk_info":"Use clean money to buy a stolen list for the current stage. Each list is good for {n} calls. Names and phones: +1 trust. Bank details: +1 and shows the victim's weak spot right away. Full package: +2. Every call with a list draws more police attention, and 1 in {f} lists is fake (sold by a rival).","tr_n":["Smooth talker","Night owl","Caffeine","Charmer","Techie","Lazy","Nervous","Loyal","Snitch","Greedy","Polyglot","Lucky"],"tr_d":["+30 % output","+60 % at night, −20 % by day","+60 % in the morning, −10 % the rest of the day","every call pays +4 %","draws no police attention","−40 % output, but half the attention","+20 % output, but twice the attention","never leaves the team in a crisis","+40 % output, but talks too much (+80 % attention)","+50 % output, but +30 % attention","+50 % outside Portugal","+25 % output"],"tm55_hi":"{n} joined the team ({r} · {t}).","tm55_up":"{n} reached level {l}!","tm55_fire":"Fire","tm55_fq":"Fire {n}? No severance: you lose what you paid.","tm55_fired":"{n} cleared their desk and left.","tm55_info":"Every hire has a name, a trait and a level (it rises with play time, up to 5; each level gives +15 %). Each role’s effect is the sum of what each person brings. You can fire anyone you don’t want (✖).","in55_t":"There is a mole in the team","in55_cl":["{n} always asks where the servers are.","{n} takes notes in every meeting.","{n} said \"affirmative\" on the phone.","{n}'s headset has a blinking light.","{n} never shows up in the team photos.","{n} arrived on time every single day. Odd.","{n} asked for your real name.","{n} was seen whispering into a jacket collar."],"in55_h":"If you work out who it is, tap 🔎 next to them. Clues can be misleading.","in55_acc":"Unmask","in55_q":"Accuse {n} of being an undercover agent? If you are wrong, they will walk out offended.","in55_ok":"Caught! {n} really was an undercover agent 