ore the judge’s warrant arrived.\"","rg_disco":"Prosecutor: \"A trainee officer copied the hard drive on the spot, without anyone’s authorisation.\"","rg_telem":"Prosecutor: \"We found 40 prepaid phones in the office. We do not know whose they are.\"","rg_escuta":"Prosecutor: \"We have a recording of a voice very similar to the defendant’s.\"","rg_digital":"Prosecutor: \"The defendant’s fingerprint was on the office door, on Tuesday at 10 am.\""},"jt55_d":["Evidence obtained without a warrant!","That proves nothing.","I was somewhere else."],"jt55_hint":"Your lawyer whispers: \"{d}\"","jt55_y":["The judge nods: \"Fair point.\"","The prosecutor is lost for words.","\"Evidence dismissed!\""],"jt55_n":["The judge frowns.","\"That convinces nobody.\"","Someone in the gallery laughs."],"jt55_v":["NOT GUILTY","SUSPENDED SENTENCE","GUILTY"],"jt55_vd":["The judge orders part of the money returned and the police back off.","A token fine and a warning.","You stay on the police radar."],"jt55_r0":"Not guilty! You got back {x} and attention drops.","jt55_r1":"Suspended sentence. You got back {x}.","jt55_r2":"Guilty. +10 police attention.","pe55_t":"Prison break","pe55_d":"You were arrested. Hold the button to move and let go when the guard turns around (❗).","pe55_st":["Dig the tunnel with a spoon","Hide in the laundry cart","Climb down the bedsheet rope"],"pe55_ok":["Tunnel open!","Out in the cart!","Outside!"],"pe55_seen":"The guard saw you!","pe55_hold":"Hold to move","pe55_give":"Give up","pe55_won":"You broke out! You are now on {a} of {n} busts: the next one is the last.","pe55_info":"In hardcore mode, the 3rd bust sends you to prison, but you get one escape attempt per jurisdiction run. If the guard sees you 3 times, it is over.","ps55_t":"Prestige shop","ps55_c":"Spend fake passports on upgrades that last forever.","ps55_open":"Open the shop","ps55_dd":"You have {n} passports. Every passport you spend stops giving +5 % income; sell the upgrade and you get the passports 