best: {b} · tries left: {n}","dc55_rw":"Daily challenge done! Streak: {n} day(s) in a row. Reward: police attention drops faster for 45 s.","dc55_info":"Every day there is one challenge, the same for everyone (differences, laundering or car chase, in turn). You get {n} tries; the best one counts. Doing it on consecutive days grows your streak. The daily leaderboard comes with the online version.","os55_t":"The other side","os55_sub":"you are the victim: don’t get fooled","os55_d":"This time you are the one answering. Pick the right replies and don’t fall for the scam.","os55_win":"You didn’t fall for it! You unmasked the scammer.","os55_lose":"You fell for the scam.","os55_sc":[{"n":"The fake bank employee","d":"Your phone rings. \"This is your bank’s security department.\"","l":"Banks never ask for codes, PINs or transfers to \"safe accounts\". Hang up and call the official number yourself.","p":[{"q":"We detected a suspicious 800 payment on your account. Was that you?","o":["I’ll hang up and call the bank’s official number myself.","It wasn’t me! What do I do?","It wasn’t me! Tell me what to do, quickly."],"f":["Perfect: that way you talk to the real bank.","You are still on the line with the caller. Careful.","Rushing is exactly what they want."]},{"q":"To cancel it, I’ll send you a code by SMS. Please read it to me.","o":["Codes are only for me. I don’t tell anyone.","What is the code for?","Sure, the code is 4 8 2 1 9."],"f":["Right: with the code they would get into your account.","Good question, but don’t read it out.","With the code they made the transfer. Scam complete."]},{"q":"The system is slow. To protect your money, move it to a bank safe account.","o":["There are no \"safe accounts\". I’m hanging up.","What is that account called?","OK, send me the account number."],"f":["Exactly. No bank asks for this.","The name doesn’t matter: it is the scammer’s account.","The money went to the scammer."]},{"q":"If you hang up, your account will be blocked forever!","o":["I’ll hang up and talk to my branch.","Blocked forever?!","Fine, I’ll do whatever you say."],"f":["Threats are a warning sign. Well done.","It’s a lie meant to scare you.","Fear made you give in."]}]},{"n":"\"Hi Mum, new number\"","d":"Message from an unknown number: \"Hi Mum, my phone broke. This is my new number.\"","l":"If a relative writes from a new number asking for money, call their old number or ask something only they would know.","p":[{"q":"Hi Mum! I dropped my phone in the toilet. Save this number 😘","o":["I’ll call your old number to check.","Oh dear, are you OK?","Saved! Tell me everything."],"f":["Checking the old number breaks the scam.","You still don’t know who it is.","You already trusted an unknown number."]},{"q":"The old number doesn’t work, it’s broken. I need an urgent favour…","o":["Then tell me the name of our first dog.","What favour?","Of course, anything you need!"],"f":["A question only your child knows.","Careful with what comes next.","You promised before knowing what it was."]},{"q":"I have to pay a bill today and the bank app isn’t working yet. Can you send me 650?","o":["No. We’ll talk when I hear your voice on the phone.","To which account?","Sending it now!"],"f":["Very good: no voice, no money.","You are about to send it.","The 650 went to the scammer."]},{"q":"Mum, please, it’s really urgent 😢 I’ll pay you back!","o":["I’ll call your dad to check.","Oh, how awful…","OK, OK, sending it."],"f":["Bringing someone else in breaks the lie.","Emotion is their weapon.","The emotional pressure worked."]}]},{"n":"The parcel on hold","d":"SMS: \"Your parcel is on hold. Pay 1.99 at: post-deliveries.net\"","l":"Don’t click links in texts that charge fees. Go to the official site or app by typing the address yourself.","p":[{"q":"Your parcel is on hold due to an unpaid 1.99 fee.","o":["I’m not expecting anything. I’ll ignore it.","Which parcel could it be?","Only 1.99? I’ll pay now."],"f":["Right: don’t even reply.","Curiosity is the hook.","The small amount is the bait."]},{"q":"Click the link to choose a delivery date: post-deliveries.net","o":["I’ll go to the official site by typing the address myself.","The link looks odd…","I’ll click and see."],"f":["That way you avoid a fake site.","You were right: don’t click.","You landed on a fake site."]},{"q":"Enter your card details to pay the fee.","o":["I leave the site and enter nothing.","Does the post office ask for this?","Fine, here are my details."],"f":["Perfect. Your details stayed with you.","It doesn’t. Leave now.","With your details they emptied your card."]},{"q":"Final notice! Without payment today, the parcel will be returned.","o":["If it’s true, it will show up on the official site.","What now?","I’ll pay so I don’t lose it."],"f":["Very good: you check through the official channel.","The pressure is fake.","The \"final notice\" worked."]}]},{"n":"The fake computer technician","d":"Someone calls: \"We are tech support. Your computer is sending out viruses.\"","l":"No company calls to warn you about viruses. Never install programs or give remote access to someone who called you.","p":[{"q":"Your computer is infected and spreading viruses on the internet!","o":["Nobody calls about that. I’m hanging up.","Really? How do you know?","Oh no, help me!"],"f":["Exactly: it’s a classic scam.","They know nothing. It’s a lie.","Fear opened the door."]},{"q":"Install this program so I can look at the problem remotely.","o":["I don’t install anything for someone who called me.","What program is it?","It’s installed."],"f":["That way nobody gets into your computer.","It’s a remote-access program.","Now they control your computer."]},{"q":"To finish, log in to your bank so I can confirm the licence.","o":["I never open my bank with strangers watching.","Why do you need my bank?","OK, I’m logged in."],"f":["Perfect. Your bank has nothing to do with viruses.","They don’t. Be suspicious.","They saw everything and emptied the account."]},{"q":"The licence costs 299 in gift cards. Can you buy them?","o":["No serious company asks for gift cards. Hanging up.","Gift cards? How odd…","I’ll go and buy them."],"f":["Right: gift cards are money gone for good.","Very odd indeed.","The money vanished."]}]}],"fx551_ok":"Your money was restored from the game’s backup copy.","fx551_cp":"A game bug wiped your money. You got compensation so you can keep going.","my56_sub":"leaderboard, statistics, delete","ab56_t":"About the game","ab56_sub":"version, music and credits","ab56_ver":"Version {v}","pv56_none":"The privacy policy did not come with this version of the game.","cf56_r":"Reading and colours","cf56_e":"Screen","cf56_j":"Game","cf56_p":"Parental controls","on56_net":"No connection to the server. Try again later.","my56_on":"Online features","my56_on_d":"Anyone with your friend code sees the runs you won in the friends leaderboard. If you join a syndicate, the other members see your operator name and the calls you win during the week.","my56_sd":"Syndicate: {n}","my56_del":"Delete my online data","my56_delq":"Delete all runs from this phone on the server and leave the syndicate? Your friends list stays on the phone.","my56_deld":"Online data deleted ({n} runs).","fr56_t":"Friends","fr56_d":"Share your code with anyone you like and add your friends’ codes. In the leaderboard, the “Friends” tab shows only your group’s runs.","fr56_my":"Your friend code","fr56_share":"Share","fr56_copied":"Copied!","fr56_sh":"My SCAM Operator friend code: {c}","fr56_rkoff":"Sending scores is turned off: your friends can’t see your runs.","fr56_add":"Add a friend","fr56_nick":"Name (optional)","fr56_addb":"Add","fr56_list":"Your friends ({n}/{m})","fr56_best":"best run: {m}","fr56_none":"no runs won yet","fr56_del":"Remove","fr56_empty":"You haven’t added anyone yet. Ask a friend for their code.","fr56_rank":"See the friends leaderboard","fr56_manage":"Manage","fr56_bad":"That code isn’t valid: it has 8 letters and numbers, like ABCD-EFGH.",